[DOM] for the zero-order organization, Recent Orders shows an empty-state message equivalent to 'No orders yet' and Top Sellers independently shows one equivalent to 'No sales in this period' {SPEC}
[STATE] a category chip represents the product's TOP-LEVEL catalog ancestor, not its own leaf sub-category — one chip may cover multiple sub-categories {SPEC}

